      <h1 id="sms-privacy-policy-for-the-sales-rebellion-llc">SMS Privacy Policy for The Sales Rebellion, LLC</h1>
      <p><strong>Last Updated: September 2, 2025</strong></p>
      <p>The Sales Rebellion, LLC (&quot;we,&quot; &quot;us,&quot; or &quot;our&quot;) values your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal information. This SMS Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you opt-in to receive SMS (text message) communications from us. By opting in to our SMS program, you agree to the terms of this policy.</p>
      <h2 id="1-information-we-collect">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>When you opt-in to our SMS program, we may collect the following information:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your mobile phone number.</li>
        <li>Any personal information you voluntarily provide in response to our text messages (e.g., name, email, or other details shared during communication).</li>
        <li>Metadata related to your interaction with our SMS messages, such as the date and time of messages and your responses.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2 id="2-how-we-collect-your-information">2. How We Collect Your Information</h2>
      <p>We collect your mobile phone number and related information when you:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Voluntarily provide it by opting in to our SMS program (e.g., through a website form, keyword opt-in, or in-person registration).</li>
        <li>Respond to our SMS campaigns or engage with our text-based services.</li>
        <li>Provide additional information via text in response to our messages.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To opt-in, you may be asked to send a specific keyword (e.g., &quot;JOIN&quot;) to a designated short code or phone number, or you may provide your phone number through our website or other platforms. By opting in, you consent to receive SMS messages from The Sales Rebellion, LLC.</p>
      <h2 id="3-how-we-use-your-information">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use the information collected through our SMS program to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Send you promotional messages, including offers, discounts, and updates about our products or services.</li>
        <li>Provide customer support and respond to your inquiries or requests.</li>
        <li>Send event reminders, order confirmations, or other transactional messages.</li>
        <li>Improve our SMS campaigns by analyzing engagement data (e.g., open rates or responses).</li>
        <li>Comply with legal obligations or enforce our rights.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2 id="4-opting-in-and-out">4. Opting In and Out</h2>
      <p><strong>Opt-In</strong>: By providing your mobile phone number and opting in, you consent to receive SMS messages from The Sales Rebellion, LLC. You may opt-in via our website, by texting a keyword, or through other methods we provide. You must be 18 years or older to participate in our SMS program.</p>
      <p><strong>Opt-Out</strong>: You may opt-out of receiving SMS messages at any time by texting &quot;STOP&quot; to the number from which you receive our messages. After opting out, you will receive a confirmation message and no further marketing messages will be sent unless you opt-in again. You may also contact us at [insert contact email or phone number] to opt-out.</p>
      <h2 id="5-message-frequency">5. Message Frequency</h2>
      <p>The frequency of SMS messages will vary depending on the program or campaign you have opted into. We will inform you of the expected message frequency at the time of opt-in. Message and data rates may apply, as determined by your mobile carrier.</p>
      <h2 id="6-sharing-your-information">6. Sharing Your Information</h2>
      <p>We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information, including your mobile phone number, to third parties. We may share your information only in the following circumstances:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>With service providers who assist us in operating our SMS program (e.g., SMS platform providers), provided they agree to keep your information confidential.</li>
        <li>To comply with legal obligations, such as responding to a subpoena or court order.</li>
        <li>To protect our rights, property, or safety, or that of our customers or the public.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2 id="7-data-security">7. Data Security</h2>
      <p>We implement reasonable security measures to protect your information from unauthorized access, use, or disclosure. However, no method of transmission over the internet or electronic storage is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>
      <h2 id="8-data-retention">8. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>We retain your mobile phone number and related SMS data for as long as you remain opted-in to our SMS program or as required to fulfill the purposes outlined in this policy. If you opt-out, we will retain your phone number only as necessary to ensure you do not receive further messages and to comply with applicable laws.</p>
      <h2 id="9-third-party-links">9. Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p>Our SMS messages may include links to third-party websites or services. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of these third parties. We encourage you to review the privacy policies of any third-party sites you visit.</p>
      <h2 id="10-changes-to-this-policy">10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this SMS Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or legal requirements. If we make material changes, we will notify you via SMS or other reasonable means before the changes take effect. Your continued participation in our SMS program after such changes constitutes your acceptance of the updated policy.</p>
      <h2 id="11-contact-us">11. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions or concerns about this SMS Privacy Policy or our SMS program, please contact us at:</p>
      <p>The Sales Rebellion, LLC<br>[Insert Company Address]<br>Email: [Insert Contact Email]<br>Phone: [Insert Contact Phone Number]</p>
      <h2 id="12-your-rights">12. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have certain rights regarding your personal information, such as the right to access, correct, or delete your data. To exercise these rights, please contact us using the information provided above. We will respond to your request in accordance with applicable laws.</p>
      <p>By participating in our SMS program, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by this SMS Privacy Policy.</p>

